<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech utility SME 9-mo profit 840 mln.</title>
<headline>Czech utility SME 9-mo profit 840 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for nine-month period ending September 30, 1997 (in millions of crowns) according to Czech accounting standards:</p>
<p> Gross profit		   840     vs     869</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p>   and services	     9,750     vs   9,456</p>
<p> Total turnover	   10,3400     vs     n/a</p>
<p>Note - Full company name is Severomoravska Energetika a.s., a northeastern power distributor in the Czech Republic based in Ostrava.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
